   "body": "### Mac check passed (mac/verify-merges, 2026-11-02)\nSimulator, iOS 27.0, iPhone 18 Pro and iPad Pro 13-inch (M5), dev-swift `34c4e556` plus #377 (merged as `1c5cd6f`).\n\n1. **Light and dark**: section headers, toggles, slider and picker are legible on both devices. Screenshots: iPhone [light](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/docs/mac-checks-344-322/docs/assets/checks/322-1.png) and [dark](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/docs/mac-checks-344-322/docs/assets/checks/322-2.png); iPad [light](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/docs/mac-checks-344-322/docs/assets/checks/322-6.png) and [dark](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/docs/mac-checks-344-322/docs/assets/checks/322-7.png).\n2. **Dynamic Type**: XL ([iPhone](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/docs/mac-checks-344-322/docs/assets/checks/322-3.png)) and AX5, the largest accessibility size ([iPhone](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/docs/mac-checks-344-322/docs/assets/checks/322-4.png), [iPad](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/docs/mac-checks-344-322/docs/assets/checks/322-8.png)). Rows wrap, no label is clipped, the \"100 %\" value stays readable, and the Icône and Thème rows can be tapped and open at AX5 (on iPhone that needs #377: before it they opened nothing at any size). Minor, not a defect: at AX5 the start-screen value is truncated on iPhone (\"Tab…égories\"), and the iPad sidebar hyphenates its labels (LOT-170, outside this issue).\n3. **Rotation lock**: with rotation off, iPhone stays portrait when landscape is requested ([322-5](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/docs/mac-checks-344-322/docs/assets/checks/322-5.png)) and rotates again once it is back on. iPad rotates with the lock on ([322-9](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/docs/mac-checks-344-322/docs/assets/checks/322-9.png)).\n\nScreenshots: PR #381 (closes this issue).\n",
